cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UCAP, please cite the diploma project below."
type: software
title: "UCAP — Utility Carve-out of Anonymisation Protocol"
authors:
  - family-names: Kostarczyk
    given-names: Bartosz
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-10"
abstract: >-
  Depth-gated anonymization pipeline for egocentric RGB video: recall-first
  promptable segmentation (SAM 3) gated by a metric depth estimate (UniDepth v2
  or stereo SGBM) preserves the near-field interaction zone while redacting
  background PII; unresolved privacy/utility collisions are flagged for human
  review rather than resolved silently.
preferred-citation:
  type: report
  title: "Reconciling Privacy and Utility in Egocentric RGB Video: A Depth-Gated Anonymization Pipeline for Embodied-AI Training Data"
  authors:
    - family-names: Kostarczyk
      given-names: Bartosz
  year: 2026
  institution:
    name: "Kozminski University"
